Z||000000||Mach10||09-18-2001||03:09 AM||||Here's to show that Winnipeg cares. From a straight line, from my house, to the girlfriends (across the city) here's what I saw:<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR><I>Can't see it, but the white sign says "Our prayers are with you, America"</I><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.escape.ca/~fogg/godbless.jpg">  <BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR><I>Signboard says "God Bless America"</I> <IMG SRC="http://www.escape.ca/~fogg/godbless_2.jpg"> <BR><p>[This message has been edited by Mach10 (edited 09-18-2001).]||||reg||7
Z||000001||Mach10||09-18-2001||03:24 AM||||.<BR>.<BR>.<BR><I>At the corner of Portage and Main, pretty much the center of the city, 3 american flags at half-mast. (can't see the third, it's behind the tree</I><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.escape.ca/~fogg/portage-main.jpg">  <BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR><I>The Richardson building, owned by one of the more wealthy citizens shows it's respects.</I><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.escape.ca/~fogg/Richardson.jpg">  <BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR><I>All the schools I've seen are flying flags at half-mast. This is "Argyle High School" </I><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.escape.ca/~fogg/schools.jpg">  <BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR><I>At one of the larger Husky Stations</I>  <IMG SRC="http://www.escape.ca/~fogg/3_flags.jpg">  <BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR><I>An example of the strip-malls across town. Again, half-mast</I><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.escape.ca/~fogg/strip-malls.jpg">  <BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR><I>What *should* have been the best pic, but limited to this funky digital camera. I touched it up as best I could. Just pretend that it wasn't so dark, and the colors richer...</I><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.escape.ca/~fogg/setting-sun.jpg">  <P>------------------<BR>"Duct Tape is Good to Mach 3"<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.escape.ca/~fogg/halfpole.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||My7Fieros||09-18-2001||03:50 AM||||Cool beans. Its nice to see other countries sympathize w/ us. Very classy.<BR>I dont know whats wierder...seeing American flags fly in Canada, or seeing the Canadian flag in the center post w/ no American flag. (which makes since because its in Canada, still, you know what I mean  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> )<BR>Thumbs up!<P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I>||||reg||14
